<div class="pro-product-intro"><div class="pro-product-intro-copy"><p class="pro-kicker">AVOCADOPRO / FIRST-BUILD INTEREST OPEN</p><h1 id="pro-build-title">Meet avocadoPro.</h1><p class="pro-product-lead">A dedicated AI PC for the work you want to make.</p><p class="pro-product-body">Explore a complete machine concept and the real NVIDIA graphics, memory, and storage references behind it. Choose a build, save it, and tell us what you would use it for. The first physical prototype is planned in a silver Lian Li A4-H2O case. The rounded Studio image is a design study, not a photo of that machine. Your input will shape the build.</p><div class="pro-product-actions"><a class="pro-product-primary" href="#pro-customize">Explore the machine <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="pro-product-secondary" href="#pro-interest">Join the first-build list <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="pro-product-availability">Concept stage · no final price, order, or delivery date yet.</p></div><div class="pro-product-visual"><img src="/images/avocado-pro-value-study.webp" alt="Silver avocadoPro compact AI PC enclosure concept, seen from the front" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="pro-product-visual-label">THE MACHINE / STUDIO CONCEPT</span></div></div>
    <section id="purpose" class="product-purpose" aria-labelledby="pro-purpose-title"><p class="pro-kicker">WHY PRO / AI COMPUTING &amp; COMPONENT SUPPLY</p><h2 id="pro-purpose-title">AI-dedicated PCs.<br />A stronger supply base.</h2><p>Pro has two connected purposes: give people a dedicated PC for AI work, and use the business of building and selling these PCs to develop sustained access to semiconductors and related components.</p><div class="purpose-grid"><article><h3>Put AI to work.</h3><p>A dedicated computer for AI models, agents, creation, and computation. Pro works independently; Mini is optional.</p></article><article><h3>Build demand into a plan.</h3><p>Use real customer needs and validated PC configurations to understand which GPUs, memory, processors, and other parts are needed.</p></article><article><h3>Develop reliable supply.</h3><p>Work toward repeatable sourcing, supplier relationships, and component availability through the PC business.</p></article></div><p class="purpose-note">Securing components is a business objective, not a claim of secured inventory, supply allocations, or signed supplier agreements. Quantities, budgets, sourcing, and hardware fit still require approval and evidence. This does not mean we manufacture semiconductor chips. No final price or paid order is available.</p></section>
<div class="pro-product-story" aria-label="What avocadoPro is for"><div><span>01 / COMPUTE</span><strong>Your own AI hardware.</strong><p>Explore NVIDIA graphics, memory, and storage for local AI work. Performance still needs a prototype.</p></div><div><span>02 / FREEDOM</span><strong>Work beyond the desk.</strong><p>The product goal is to create and communicate through agents without staying in front of the PC or holding a phone.</p></div><div><span>03 / YOUR BUILD</span><strong>Make the machine yours.</strong><p>Inspect the parts, compare a few starting configurations, and save the one you want to see built.</p></div></div>
